[[File:Ryme Wharf Detective Pikachu.png|thumb|280px|A depiction of Ryme Harbor from [[Detective Pikachu Ryme City Guide]]]]
'''Ryme Wharf''' (Japanese: '''ライム{{tt|埠頭|ふとう}}''' ''Ryme Wharf'') is a wharf located in South Water, a district south of central [[Ryme City|Ryme]] in the game {{OBP|Detective Pikachu|video game}}. Its port is located in the western side of Ryme Harbor<ref>Detective Pikachu Ryme City Guide</ref>. Goods from all over the world are stored in the many warehouses located around the area. Most of Chapter 7 takes place here.

